flowchart TD
  Scope[Designer accepted observable scope; hardware/implementation pending] --> Hardware[Actual closed and full-sweep retained-frame geometry gate]
  Hardware -->|first prototype failed| Revise[Fixed rear stop / non-bearing flange revision; preserve full padding]
  Revise --> Hardware
  Hardware -->|must pass before clip/export| Manifest[Quote immutable actual packets and above-overlap dependencies]
  Manifest --> Source[Receiving selects actual lower M05 job at hauling priority]
  Source --> Empty{All actual upper-pan stock removed?}
  Empty -->|no| Wait[Retain lower stock aboard / existing upper-first dependencies]
  StockEvent[Actual indexed stock change] --> Empty
  Empty -->|yes| Clear{Actual mechanism/worker clearance ready?}
  Clear -->|no| Clearance[Wait for actual access event]
  Clearance --> Clear
  Clear -->|yes| Prepare[Finite automatic unlock / fold / secure action]
  Prepare --> Parked[Fully parked and latched; pickup may begin]
  Parked --> Pickup[Receiving actual lower-bale pickup / unchanged custody authority]
  Pickup --> Receipt[Actual carry and finite warehouse handoff]
  Pause[Global pause freezes activity time and mechanism] -.-> Prepare
  UpperPlacement[Any later upper loading] --> Closed{Pan closed and locked?}
  Closed -->|no| Reject[No upper placement until actual close/lock completion]
  Closed -->|yes| Support[Full retained bearing face and original capacity]
  View[Artist mechanism clip presents committed state; no stock authority] -.-> Prepare
  Note[Prospective design only: no runtime or native acceptance from diagram] -.-> Manifest
